hn weightily, “and fur as little reason as theer is in this theer boot, ” holding up an unornamental specimen of the style of footgear patronised by male rustics at the commencement of the present century, “You see, sir, ” he pursued, after a brief pause — (Acts awaited details) — “my…","h":[89,93],"a":["theer"],"bk":"uc1.$b250355.clean","g":null,"gb":"m"}],"1880":[{"s":"But I didn't keer for anything but to comfort him, an' I made up my mind that I was going to have somethin' in that theer shoe of his that night if I had to tell a whopper.","h":[122,126],"a":["theer"],"bk":"nyp.33433066584461.clean","g":null,"gb":null}],"1890":[{"s":"Thar war deep enough pockets ter theer trousers, but nary a one ter theer mines.","h":[39,47],"a":["theer"],"bk":"nyp.33433076069347.clean","g":null,"gb":null},{"s":"That theer jacket, now — I bowt that at t' best shop i' Sicaster when t' owd missis died.","h":[11,17],"a":["theer"],"bk":"nyp.33433075728612.clean","g":null,"gb":"f"},{"s":"I feel orful sheepish, but Stella sez ennyone aint stilish, unless they hev steals n' theer skirts, n' wear bussels.","h":[92,98],"a":["theer"],"bk":"nyp.33433074847884.clean","g":null,"gb":"m"},{"s":"That theer jacket, now — I bowt that at t' best shop i' Sicaster when t' owd missis died.","h":[11,17],"a":["theer"],"bk":"nyp.33433075728612.clean","g":null,"gb":null}],"1900":[{"s":"\"Now give me that theer hat!\"","h":[24,27],"a":["theer"],"bk":"mdp.39015063511409.clean","g":null,"gb":"m"},{"s":"…about a small village, I do assure 'e, an' but for his thin, crooked legs, as gived onder unlike a pair o' flails, many a chap would have dealt the swine a righteous clout 'pon the ear hole, or else taken theer workin' boots to un, hobnails an’ all.","h":[220,225],"a":["theer"],"bk":"wu.89088300389.clean","g":null,"gb":null},{"s":"\"Now give me that theer hat!\"","h":[24,27],"a":["theer"],"bk":"mdp.39015063511409.clean","g":null,"gb":"f"},{"s":"…about a small village, I do assure 'e, an' but for his thin, crooked legs, as gived onder unlike a pair o' flails, many a chap would have dealt the swine a righteous clout 'pon the ear hole, or else taken theer workin' boots to un, hobnails an’ all.","h":[220,225],"a":["theer"],"bk":"wu.89088300389.clean","g":null,"gb":null},{"s":"…about a small village, I do assure 'e, an' but for his thin, crooked legs, as gived onder unlike a pair o' flails, many a chap would have dealt the swine a righteous clout 'pon the ear hole, or else taken theer workin' boots to un, hobnails an’ all.","h":[220,225],"a":["theer"],"bk":"wu.89088300389.clean","g":null,"gb":"m"}],"1910":[{"s":"\"Now give me that theer hat!\"","h":[24,27],"a":["theer"],"bk":"njp.32101054938301.clean","g":null,"gb":"m"},{"s":"V y then, to begin vith, that theer coat o' yours — it's too long to run in off vith it, sir!”","h":[36,40],"a":["long","theer"],"bk":"uc1.b3834475.clean","g":null,"gb":"f"},{"s":"\"Now give me that theer hat!\"","h":[24,27],"a":["theer"],"bk":"njp.32101054938301.clean","g":null,"gb":"f"},{"s":"\"V'y, then, to begin vith, that theer coat o' yours, — it's too long to run in — off vith it, sir!\"","h":[38,42],"a":["theer"],"bk":"mdp.39015063552882.clean","g":null,"gb":"m"},{"s":"V y then, to begin vith, that theer coat o' yours — it's too long to run in off vith it, sir!”","h":[36,40],"a":["long","theer"],"bk":"uc1.b3834475.clean","g":null,"gb":null},{"s":"\"V'y, then, to begin vith, that theer coat o' yours, — it's too long to run in — off vith it, sir!\"","h":[38,42],"a":["theer"],"bk":"mdp.39015063552882.clean","g":null,"gb":null}]},"pairs":{"hat":{"1840":[{"s":"“Now give me that theer hat!”","h":[24,27],"a":["theer"],"bk":"mdp.39015063511425.clean","g":null,"gb":"m"},{"s":"“Now give me that theer hat!”","h":[24,27],"a":["theer"],"bk":"mdp.39015063511425.clean","g":null,"gb":"m"},{"s":"“Now give me that theer hat!”","h":[24,27],"a":["theer"],"bk":"mdp.39015063511425.clean","g":null,"gb":"m"},{"s":"“Now give me that theer hat!”","h":[24,27],"a":["theer"]